sequenceDiagram
 participant L as Low-priority task
 participant S as Scheduler
 participant H as High-priority task
 L->>L: Acquire lock
 H->>S: Arrive and become ready
 S-->>H: Preempt low-priority owner
 loop High-priority task stays runnable
  H->>H: TestAndSet sees lock held
 end
 Note over L,H: Owner needs CPU time to release the lock
